  "description": "Bull Market Week 15 - Weekly Wrap Up",
  "body_html": "<p>What a eye watering week of gains! All that sitting around is finally paying off. Rigetti, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGTI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> broke over 54% in profits, a position we dollar cost averaged up (meaning your % gains may be smaller, but your % gains should be larger). I confess, I sold off RGTI on 9/18, but snuck in quietly to <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$QUBT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>   for another 17.6%.  Be sure to use the StockTok Screener (linked below) which has consistently provided high batting averages and high returns in relatively short periods of time. If you are unfamiliar with it, read the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">FAQ</a>  document. </p><p>With one interest rate cut, my primary focus is now on January 2026 FOMC. I will be updating <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-157072127\">this note weekly with changes in interest rate forecasts</a>. We want speculators to continue speculating MORE interest rate cuts, regardless of whether they happen or not. The combination of that speculation, and the fear that markets are “toppy”…will only continue to leave people behind as we push higher. Of course, as always, respect price action above all. Price is King!</p><p>Some of this week’s highlights include:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/blowoff-top-becoming-more-clear-2?r=4z8lgl\">Blow Off Top Is Becoming More Obvious</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-more-of-this-stock-market?r=4z8lgl\">Bought more of another stock</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/selling-rigetti?r=4z8lgl\">Always keep a look out if I have a flash stock sale</a></p></li></ul><p>I don’t typically like buying on Friday…no idea what will happen over the weekend, I like to see prices holding on Monday before I pick up anything new….but if we do, then I expect we will continue to add to positions or pick up new ones. </p><p>Oh…one other cool note: <strong>Yahoo Finance asked me to do a write up for a Ticker of my choosing. </strong>I wont reveal the ticker…many of you already know which tickers I like. I don’t want to be accused of pumping and dumping. Regardless, super cool to be on a mainstream piece, and my words will be 100% mine, not chopped up. I’ve turned down several mainstream media (CNN, Fox Business and Business Insider most notably) in fear of them twisting words or information. Pretty excited about it!</p><p>Hope you have a great weekend, feel free to ping me in the chat during market hours for any questions…and last but not least…thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
